Package: zinc
Version: 0.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Maintainer: zinc contributors <zien0709@gmail.com>
Description: A free, self-hosted long-URL generator on Cloudflare Quick Tunnels
 zinc turns any link into a short, secret URL on a Cloudflare Quick Tunnel
 and gives you a terminal dashboard to see who opened it, change where it
 goes, and destroy it. No account, no server, no domain required.
 .
 zinc is a single statically-linked binary; no Python or dependencies needed.
Homepage: https://github.com/zien0709/zinc
